+ * token from the same account shares the same limits), and the other tools keep the main budget to themselves.
+ * Until it is set, MyMISMO is held to MYMISMO_WRITE_CAP saves an hour (default 250) on the shared account, so it can
+ * never use up what everything else needs; past that its saves answer "busy" and the app keeps them and tries later. */
